'''''Talcahuano''''' '''(DDH-84)''' is a {{W|helicopter carrier}} of the Baliscan [[Confederal Navy]] (''Marina confederales''). Officially classified as a multi-purpose operation destroyer with the potential for a future conversion into an full-fledged {{W|aircraft carrier}}, ''Talcahuano'' is the second ship of the [[Arruazu-class helicopter carrier]]s. In line with the [[Naval Vessels Naming Initiative]], its namesake is a mountain peak in the [[Küyenmapu]] region in present-day [[Cerdanya]].

